Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.50,0:00:22.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about it? \NFound anything good?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:24.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, no such luck...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.33,0:00:27.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That won't do. You've got to fend for yourself here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.41,0:00:51.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.28,0:00:53.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.86,0:00:54.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We are...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.99,0:00:57.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looking at your skin and eyes, I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.46,0:01:00.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're people from Ishbal, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.29,0:01:04.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a gathering place for \Nthose who, for whatever reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.44,0:01:06.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,cannot live in the lands of their birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.75,0:01:09.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've got petty criminals and corrupt soldiers
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.04,0:01:11.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,who have been found out and ousted here as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.58,0:01:15.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Laughable, isn't it? \NHere, have a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.80,0:01:22.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A-An Ishbalan with a scar on his face!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.22,0:01:24.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've heard about this guy before!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.27,0:01:27.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait! Hey, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.48,0:01:28.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait up, I say!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.70,0:01:33.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for popping off \Nat you like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.48,0:01:44.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He merged himself with the wall?! Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.00,0:01:45.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.65,0:01:49.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Jeez, I'm in a hurry here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.21,0:01:50.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.71,0:01:55.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They say that despite \Nbeing a State Alchemist,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.20,0:01:58.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you have an interest in \Nthe Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.10,0:02:05.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man cannot obtain anything \Nwithout first sacrificing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.85,0:02:10.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to obtain anything, \Nsomething of equal value is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.11,0:02:15.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is alchemy's \NLaw of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.85,0:02:21.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, we believed that \Nto be the true way of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.05,0:04:01.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ham, 100 grams, 128 cens.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.28,0:04:03.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd like to see someone named Izumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.88,0:04:07.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chicken breasts, 160 cens.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.41,0:04:11.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Elric brothers wouldn't have come visiting here, would they?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.39,0:04:15.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you know them? \NPlease do something about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.09,0:04:19.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way! I don't know what that person has in mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.74,0:04:23.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, right now, \NEd and Al are probably in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.49,0:04:26.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sliced beef chuck, 200 cens.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.99,0:04:29.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We are here on military business.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.75,0:04:31.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There is no need to hide anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.02,0:04:35.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mixed ground beef and pork, 98 cens.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.04,0:04:39.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Allow me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.13,0:05:29.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, Major! Ed... Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.66,0:05:44.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looks like a friendship has been born out of their muscles, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.79,0:05:46.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.00,0:05:50.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, where are the \Ntwo of them, miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.86,0:05:57.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.33,0:06:01.25,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,There are stories floating around about how you used your brother as an experimental subject
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.25,0:06:03.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and transmuted only his spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.88,0:06:06.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or how you're being \Npursued by homunculi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.70,0:06:11.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm offering to take you \Nsomeplace safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.22,0:06:14.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Both you and your \Nfreak of a brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.05,0:06:18.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What did you say \Nhis brother was?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.09,0:06:27.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He really is hollow! \NJust like Tucker said!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.07,0:06:28.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tucker-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.17,0:06:29.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.07,0:06:32.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't get so upset \Nover what people say!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.07,0:06:33.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.60,0:06:39.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Magnificent! However...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.15,0:06:45.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm magnificent as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.51,0:06:49.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.22,0:06:54.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A Chimera?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.69,0:06:58.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me he escaped from the 5th Laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.62,0:07:01.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, Major! It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.65,0:07:05.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm. This is Lt. Colonel Archer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.18,0:07:07.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He is in charge of the \NCourt-Martial Office.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.60,0:07:10.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are you out here \Nin the countryside?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.62,0:07:14.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Court-Martial Office? \NJust like Lt. Colonel Hughes, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.38,0:07:16.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is the Lt. Colonel doing all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.85,0:07:22.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd like to ask you about that Chimera, as well as several other things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.85,0:07:25.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but now is not the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.75,0:07:29.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.35,0:07:29.14,Dialogue Alt,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.03,0:07:34.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is starting to get interesting, is it not?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.03,0:07:36.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A perfect Chimera, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.45,0:07:38.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.82,0:07:59.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.16,0:08:01.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Huh?" doesn't cover it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.42,0:08:13.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How come mine are different from yours, Ed and Al?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.28,0:08:22.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This isn't my real arm and leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.54,0:08:27.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then what happened to your real ones, Ed?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.82,0:08:33.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.11,0:08:38.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, do you remember \Nwhere you got this scar from?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.10,0:08:42.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know where.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.18,0:08:49.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe it is just a coincidence after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.02,0:08:50.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How could that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.45,0:08:55.13,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,But, Brother, your arm and leg were \Ncarried away in an equivalent exchange, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.13,0:08:57.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why would they be here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.79,0:08:59.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just too weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.64,0:09:02.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's weird. That's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.77,0:09:05.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you know, supposing that
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.08,0:09:09.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,my arm and leg were brought back from behind that doorway, then maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.09,0:09:11.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,your body, too, could be...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.73,0:09:19.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take a close look at the sole of his right foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.36,0:09:26.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're getting closer to the mystery of the 5th Laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.91,0:09:28.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's seize him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.45,0:09:30.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are we not taking the brothers?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.05,0:09:34.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've got ourselves \Nan even bigger catch. Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.61,0:09:39.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, have I done anything wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.43,0:09:42.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.57,0:09:50.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you think \Nyou're doing, Major?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.86,0:09:56.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.42,0:10:07.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Major, that boy doesn't have any memory! We've already filed a report!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.92,0:10:11.00,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,He's an important witness to the \Ndestructive activities that took place in Central.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.48,0:10:13.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll question him at the \NSouthern Command Center.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.60,0:10:15.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.55,0:10:19.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've seen this crest \Nbefore too, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.39,0:10:25.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That boy is in league \Nwith the homunculi?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.80,0:10:31.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's connected to the persons who destroyed the 5th Laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.38,0:10:37.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.29,0:10:43.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Edward Elric, we're going to have to retake your testimonies as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.45,0:10:46.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait for us at \Nyour master's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.82,0:10:52.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wasn't continuing this investigation prohibited by the Führer?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.50,0:10:57.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A long time ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.23,0:10:59.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was bitten by a fox.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.30,0:11:00.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.30,0:11:05.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That boy has the same scar \Non his shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.94,0:11:10.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's more, that leg of his \Ndoesn't appear to be his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.24,0:11:15.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you saying that boy's arm and leg \Nare yours? How could that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.71,0:11:18.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know. \NThat's why I want to verify it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.38,0:11:21.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.32,0:11:26.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't! This is the reason why Brother and I have been struggling all this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.88,0:11:32.23,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,And if you look into it—actually, \NI don't know how you would look into it—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.23,0:11:35.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but if you did find out that that is your brother's arm and leg, what would you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.10,0:11:40.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pluck them off, \Nand claim them for your own?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.02,0:11:44.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.64,0:11:48.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case, you're better off \Nnot finding out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.48,0:12:04.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yoki... Yoki... I've heard that name before somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.96,0:12:09.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He said himself that he was once in charge of a mine in the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.37,0:12:12.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, I remember now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.45,0:12:15.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's true! \NIt's the honest truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.29,0:12:19.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, that's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.75,0:12:24.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is wonderful. If it's true, then I will inform the Führer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.49,0:12:27.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He would probably allow you to return to the military.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.64,0:12:29.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.20,0:12:34.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So then, the place they took him to was, get this, the Southern Command Center!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.33,0:12:37.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's great. Nice work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.82,0:12:39.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Way to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.03,0:12:42.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Forget about the brothers for a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.69,0:12:45.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and keep an eye on him. Got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.86,0:12:51.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It sounds like the Elric brothers are just like you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.57,0:12:56.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes... I'm sure the two of them \Nwill be of use to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.19,0:13:01.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hear that Envy and Pride and them are after them,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.36,0:13:04.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so it sounded like it would be fun \Nto make off with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.99,0:13:08.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But thanks to them, it looks like we'll be able to come by something even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.02,0:13:15.48,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,To think that there would be a homunculus with the ability to use alchemy, like me...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.79,0:13:19.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll have to get him on my side, or things will be more troublesome down the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.79,0:13:21.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please let me go after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.48,0:13:26.15,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,Dumbass. You think this is someplace that you can just get away with haphazardly busting into?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.15,0:13:28.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You guys are former soldiers, so you should understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.99,0:13:33.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was once posted to the \NSouthern Command Center.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.92,0:13:37.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't go butting in where you \Naren't needed, State Alchemist.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.56,0:13:43.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, maybe we can have him at least show the other two the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.17,0:13:46.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, if you try to betray us...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.21,0:13:53.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please, suit yourself. \NI just want to see some fireworks again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.65,0:14:07.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What did you do with that boy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.75,0:14:09.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We haven't done anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.38,0:14:13.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei, why are you so particular about that boy, anyhow?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.95,0:14:18.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The military might be able to find out who he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.73,0:14:19.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, that boy is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.95,0:14:20.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.83,0:14:22.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...not human.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.27,0:14:27.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You may not believe it,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.99,0:14:32.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but we've met homunculi—created people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.02,0:14:36.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They all had powers that \Nnormal humans could not possess.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.34,0:14:40.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like a mouth that could eat any kind of metal,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.15,0:14:42.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,fingers that could penetrate anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.24,0:14:45.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and the ability to \Ntransform their body at will.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.12,0:14:49.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That boy did use alchemy,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.29,0:14:51.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but he's still some kind of monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.27,0:15:00.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you know why \Na homunculus is born?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.67,0:15:02.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Izumi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.35,0:15:09.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you think that I hadn't realized what that boy was?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.01,0:15:14.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.01,0:15:14.76,Dialogue Alt,,0,0,0,,Izumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.43,0:15:36.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's been like this for that long?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.80,0:15:38.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.16,0:15:42.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But she's so strong that \Nit always slips our minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.75,0:15:44.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What kind of illness is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.64,0:15:47.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's possible that the hospitals in Central might be able to cure—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.44,0:15:51.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, it would probably be too difficult for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.13,0:15:52.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.87,0:15:55.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hate to say it, but rather than \Ntreating her in a rural hospital like this—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.26,0:15:57.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's an incurable illness, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.16,0:16:07.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Her organs from here \Nto about here are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.02,0:16:09.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.84,0:16:12.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's like they were completely cut out from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.47,0:16:17.42,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,And the remaining organs are intricately linked to each other, maintaining their functions.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.42,0:16:20.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't even know how it is \Nthat she's holding on to her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.22,0:16:22.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, that means...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.70,0:16:26.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It almost sounds like they were carried away, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.45,0:16:31.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then, Sensei did the \Nsame thing that we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.22,0:16:33.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.87,0:16:46.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks, dear,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.11,0:16:47.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.00,0:16:52.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.22,0:16:55.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wasn't able to do anything for you before, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.95,0:16:56.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which is why...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.05,0:17:00.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please... I don't want you to see...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.50,0:17:03.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,what I'm about to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.17,0:17:26.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sig-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.37,0:17:28.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is Izumi-san inside there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.28,0:17:33.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why won't you tell me anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.81,0:17:38.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Neither will Izumi-san \Nnor Ed nor Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.58,0:17:39.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.79,0:17:43.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.00,0:17:51.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She told me she was sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.30,0:17:57.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was the one who chose to keep her from giving birth, in order to save her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.43,0:18:01.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And yet she told me
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.35,0:18:04.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,she was sorry that \Nshe wasn't able to give birth,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.51,0:18:06.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.08,0:18:08.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.11,0:18:10.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.03,0:18:14.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I didn't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.76,0:18:17.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,her sorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.31,0:18:20.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,or how hard she was taking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.92,0:18:25.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I never thought she would do \Nsomething like that on her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.12,0:18:27.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.78,0:18:31.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The same thing \Nthat Ed and Al did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.49,0:18:32.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Human transmutation?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.79,0:18:36.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She tried to bring \Nthe baby back to life?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.61,0:18:40.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She did everything by herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.91,0:18:44.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know \Nwhat she saw there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.82,0:18:48.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just that when she came back,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.02,0:18:52.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the insides of her belly were completely gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.65,0:18:56.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and she said she would never \Nbe able to have children again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.61,0:18:58.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And when she said that,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.45,0:19:00.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,she told me \Nshe was sorry again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.34,0:19:05.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's up to you, mad bomber.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.78,0:19:12.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I might be a little \Nshort on sulfur here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.23,0:19:25.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was that explosion?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.52,0:19:28.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Major, seize that woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.70,0:19:32.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.78,0:19:35.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.01,0:19:38.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's certainly festive here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.37,0:19:47.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.41,0:19:50.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please put that boy down and get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.48,0:19:57.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei, I am still \Na dog of the military!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.39,0:20:07.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why would the Führer be here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.21,0:20:20.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That lizard bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.70,0:20:25.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pardon me, but we have \Na slight interest in that boy too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.99,0:20:32.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Among Sensei, the Major, \Nnot to mention these guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.25,0:20:37.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn. A four-way standoff, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.95,0:20:44.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, it's a five-way standoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.99,0:20:57.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That man just now...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.86,0:21:00.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was he not of \Nthe people of Ishbal?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.96,0:21:02.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do not approach him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.98,0:21:06.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you not notice \Nthe tattoo on his face?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.23,0:21:09.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He is a transgressor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.64,0:21:14.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He has disobeyed God's teachings \Nand has been eternally cast out of Ishbal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.45,0:21:22.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A group of Ishbalan people, in the south, in Kishua?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.31,0:21:25.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It is believed that \NScar is among them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.54,0:21:28.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You understand, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.06,0:21:29.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.90,0:21:34.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're moving out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.25,0:21:39.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scar is in hiding in the western slums of the city of Kishua.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.62,0:21:41.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If he surrenders quietly, \Nthat will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.48,0:21:47.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If he resists, we will take him down, along with the slum's inhabitants.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.96,0:23:40.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.81,0:23:43.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 31: "Sin"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.06,0:23:47.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Give them back. \NThose belong to Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.53,0:23:51.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Getting those back is the reason why we've been traveling!
